cerpt":"理解新节点如何连接旧链表","source_key":"request_1"},{"description":"能说明 insert 返回新头节点 p，而函数内的 head 只是参数副本；调用者必须用 caller_head = insert(...) 接收返回值，否则 caller_head 仍指向旧头节点，新分配的节点不可达。","id":"obj_receive_return","source":"user_requirement","source_excerpt":"为什么调用者需要接收函数返回值","source_key":"request_1"}],"scenes":[{"depends_on":[],"forms":["text","code","visualization","exercise"],"objective_ids":["obj_link_old_head","obj_receive_return"],"purpose":"借助 head-new-A 示例，先用代码与可视化追踪 p->next = head 如何让新节点接到旧链表前面，再对比“忽略返回值”和“接收返回值”两种调用，说明为什么调用者必须用 caller_head = insert(...) 接收返回的新头指针；并练习判断两种调用后 caller_head 与可达节点。","scene_key":"scene_head_insert","title":"头插全过程：连接旧链表与接收返回值"}],"shared_example":"head-new-A","terminology":[{"meaning":"main 中的局部指针变量，保存调用者眼中的链表头；只有通过赋值接收返回值才会更新。","term":"caller_head"},{"meaning":"insert 函数的形参，是按值传入的指针副本，作用域仅在 insert 内，返回后失效。","term":"head（参数）"},{"meaning":"insert 内局部指针，分配成功时指向新分配的节点，函数返回 p。","term":"p"},{"meaning":"main 中自动存储的初始节点，初始值为 12，是旧链表的头节点。","term":"i0"},{"meaning":"两次调用中 malloc 成功分配的新节点，分别存放 4 和 7。","term":"t0 / t1"},{"meaning":"调用处写成 caller_head = insert(...)，把返回的新头指针存回 caller_head。","term":"接收返回值"},{"meaning":"调用处写成 insert(...) 而不赋值，返回值被丢弃，caller_head 不变。","term":"忽略返回值"}],"title":"头插法：新节点连接旧链表与接收返回值"},"planning_basis":{"binding":{"basis_digest":"dbfa7a38e73cf8cb36df518485019556bce56a23fc7d25dd1f18fbe0f3a28899","example_basis_digest":"2f64acc2c78f3793b085c2756b1de75124bfc38d0fb5c2c3d907cef4ad15638a","materials_digest":"a3fc33abf64a99528d9d2a94a66f9b0721e226e48084d18b384a788a8cf7ce1e","selected_example":"head-new-A","version":"head-planning-example-basis-v1"},"evidence":{"assumptions":{"actual_malloc_assumed_success":true,"actual_malloc_failure_animated":false,"allocation_success":[true,true],"c_executed":false,"cleanup_animated":false},"code_digest":"91b1b618523660921d4e7ae82eb947a732837e0de25b7366f16f1a8de77bd72a","engine_version":"head-insertion-engine-v2","example_basis_digest":"2f64acc2c78f3793b085c2756b1de75124bfc38d0fb5c2c3d907cef4ad15638a","ex